## Step 6: Evaluation Against the Truth Set

### Commands

This command was executed within a shell script to run the Python evaluation script, comparing the gently filtered variant call set 'gentle_filtered.vcf.gz' against the benchmark truth set 'truth_snps.vcf' to calculate true positives, false positives, false negatives, precision, recall, and F1 metrics, saving the output to the gentle_eval_out directory.

```
python3 evaluate_snps_v4.py \
  --truth truth_snps.vcf \
  --calls gentle_filtered.vcf.gz \
  --all-samples --tag gentle --outdir gentle_eval_out
```


The stringent filter command was executed within a shell script to run the Python evaluation script, comparing the stringently filtered variant call set 'stringent_filtered.vcf.gz' against the benchmark truth set 'truth_snps.vcf' the output to the stringent_eval_out directory.

```
python3 evaluate_snps_v4.py \
  --truth truth_snps.vcf \
  --calls stringent_filtered.vcf.gz \
  --all-samples --tag gentle --outdir stringent_eval_out
```

